Package: datacheck
Type: Package
Title: Data Check: clean raw data before analysis
Version: 1.0.0
Author: Joshua Skoczylis
Maintainer: Joshua Skoczylis <skoczylis@gmail.com>
Description: A jamovi module that helps students clean raw data before
    analysis. It reports common problems (inconsistent labels, missing-value
    codes, numbers stored as text, survey export quirks), lets the student
    decide what each value becomes, and creates cleaned variables or a new
    cleaned dataset.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Imports:
    jmvcore (>= 0.8.5),
    R6,
    ggplot2
